      "text": "[6:00PM] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is quite slow underneath the Oshodi bridge approaching Brown junction after which it gets better towards Bolade, Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport and National.\n\nTraffic then gets a bit slow inwards the Ikeja Overpass to Ajayi Farm, then better to Ile Zik.\n\nOur Men are strategically positioned to ensure traffic is smooth.\n\n@Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
